ybookjs/storybook/milestones/51/labels","id":6145980,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjE0NTk4MA==","number":51,"title":"6.1.x","description":"","creator":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":48,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-11-24T23:06:20Z","updated_at":"2021-06-08T14:05:46Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2021-06-08T14:05:46Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2020-11-25T16:28:33Z","updated_at":"2021-04-28T11:11:16Z","closed_at":"2020-11-27T14:40:56Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWith v6.1 there is a support for script tags in story template by PR #12089.\r\nNow, all script tags will be taken, modified and appended at the end of body as a `<script type=\"text/javascript\">`.\r\n\r\nWe have a script tag in the template with options for a vue component, marked as `<script type=\"text/template\">`.\r\nAnd this script is now gone and not working anymore when the story is rendered.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\n1. Add a script tag in a story template (we use html storybook) with `type=\"text/template\"`\r\n2. Open storybook and this story\r\n3. view DOM\r\n4. script tag is gone, now as a new `type=\"text/javascript\"` script tag at the end of the body\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nOnly script tags with types from the list in the PR code should taken, all others should be ignored\r\n\r\n**Code snippets**\r\nExample template code that don't work anymore:\r\n```\r\nexport const notificationTemplate = (args: Notification) => /* HTML */ `\r\n  <div data-module=\"notification\">\r\n    <script data-notification-options type=\"text/template\">\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"${args.text}\",\r\n        \"title\": \"${args.title}\",\r\n      }\r\n    </script>\r\n  </div>\r\n`;\r\n```\r\nHow to fix this Problem:\r\nsimulate.pageload.js\r\n\r\nline 91\r\nCheck should be if typeAttr is included, not is \"not included\"\r\n```\r\nif (!typeAttr || runScriptTypes.includes(typeAttr)) {}\r\n```\r\n\r\nline 99, call of `insertScriptsSequentially` should be checked for empty `scriptsToExecute`:\r\n```\r\nif (scriptsToExecute.length) {\r\n      insertScriptsSequentially(scriptsToExecute, simulateDOMContentLoaded, undefined);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/13270/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/13270/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}